{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue WAIFUs from the ruthless cybernetic evil AI! A simple, EASY TO PLAY action game where you strip away corrupted techno-clothing to break the AI\u2019s control and free the girls from their neural prisons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strip'em up in action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607040/extras/a7583bb5ff28559278b222e1bc8659b0.poster.avif?t=1773340541\" width=780 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607040/extras/a7583bb5ff28559278b222e1bc8659b0.webm?t=1773340541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607040/extras/a7583bb5ff28559278b222e1bc8659b0.mp4?t=1773340541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Star Features</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy</strong>, <strong>Standard</strong> and <strong>Arcade</strong> difficulty modes unlocked from the start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 8 waifus</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607040/extras/747be10ed667c8a319c67094377c7d5e.poster.avif?t=1773340541\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607040/extras/747be10ed667c8a319c67094377c7d5e.webm?t=1773340541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607040/extras/747be10ed667c8a319c67094377c7d5e.mp4?t=1773340541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\